    "body": "Updated with authoring requirements and to ignore the attribute if type=\"module\", per @zcorpan's advice at https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2261#discussion_r95705415 .\r\n\r\n@rniwa @Constellation I am going to tentatively proceed with nomodule instead of a more general syntax, as discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2261#discussion_r95735805 , and check the WebKit supports box. But let me know if you are not yet convinced and we can continue to discuss.\r\n\r\nI will work on web platform tests next.",
